Note: an earlier scenario3 draft used LOOKUP against demo/agent-trace/tables/demo.tsv
(table-sha256 6b2f738491306145ad47ad50c9e02d922daaae96d1866288a32ae2f8047151dd) and also
verified PASS locally on box1 — see git history commit e188744 on this branch. It was
swapped out before the box2 leg because box2's live cm-gateway.service is pinned to a
DIFFERENT table (tiny/tables/chain.tsv, a known pre-existing gap documented in
state/LOG.md 2026-09-14 and state/reports/2026-09-14-safe5e-twobox-2b.md "Notes / not
attempted"), which would have made the box2 daemon leg fail on a --table mismatch
unrelated to this episode's own validity. The CALC-only plan-execute swap avoids that
known gap entirely while keeping the "plan, then N execute steps" scenario shape.
